s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'提交并推送，自动构建发布'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'线上文章'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stage: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'反馈'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'评论区 + Twitter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'收集读者反馈，记录改进想法'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'下一篇的素材'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模板化加速\">模板化加速</h3><p>为常见的文章类型创建模板，减少每次写作的启动成本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 技术教程模板 --&gt;&#10;&#10;# [标题]&#10;&#10;## 